<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\ヘリ機内.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>We are currently broadcasting live from a drone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Next year, at long last, will be Shiyo 900.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Truly a great many things have happened over these 100 years.<PG>
However, when it comes to the event in Japan that represents these 100 years, surely it must be this sight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With special permission, we are filming with a telephoto camera from a point 50 km away from the former <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="もときし">Motoki City</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Any closer, flight becomes unstable because of electromagnetic waves, so the picture is unclear, but for more than 50 years now, no human being has set foot in this land.<PG>
The Great Sawa Earthquake, which struck 85 years ago, in Shiyo 815.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right after it, the giant cherry forest that suddenly appeared in the former Motoki City.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since then, the former Motoki City has been covered in deadly gas. It became a ghost town overnight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the past, several survey teams from various countries entered this giant cherry forest, but all of them went missing, and even now, what these giant cherry trees really are remains unknown.<PG>
Attempts were also made to take aerial photographs from airplanes and satellites, but the fog is thick and the images are extremely unclear.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Radio noise is also strong, and neither X-ray imaging nor electromagnetic imaging is possible.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Beyond even the deep sea and unclimbed peaks, it has become a realm more unknown to us humans than Mars or Venus.<PG>
For more than 80 years, a 50 km radius around the former Motoki City has remained a no-entry zone, and Minakami City, the former prefectural capital, now retains only its function of observing the former Motoki City, with no more than a small number of researchers stationed there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Will this giant cherry forest go on growing thick, still rejecting us humans?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is there an unknown paradise there that we know nothing of?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜山頂.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\糸姫赤\死月妖花遠景.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n7000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "7000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\昔荒田\折れたかんざし.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
No, this is the one I want.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even broken, it is my precious hairpin.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I will treasure it forever and ever.<PG>
My beloved Nii-sama.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I am happy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We will be together forever and ever.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For thousands of years, for tens of thousands of years, as long as she is here, we will always be together.<PG>
See, look, Nii-sama.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="しんし">divine messengers</STYLE> are <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="ことほ">blessing</STYLE> us, too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYMOVIE "eden3.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n5000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The wind is strong today.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But it is all right.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As long as she is here, the petals will last forever.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This tower, too, forever.<BR>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
